    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but feeling the weight of it doesn't make it go away. it just makes it heavier. i feel like i'm just waiting for something to happen, but nothing ever does. there's no light at the end of this, it's just more gray. sometimes i wonder if there's even a point to trying to fix something that's just... fundamentally broken inside. like, what if the stillness i'm looking for isn't something i can find while i'm still here?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
